es so you can compare  for example delta versus omegron and see  how the the antibodies present in the  vaccinated individual can neutralize the  virus  however lab tests can only tell us so  much the view among these researchers is  in the weeks it'll take them to get  results it's best to prepare for the  worst while hoping for the best tom  clark sky news glasgow
 

